@*
=========================================================
FILE: NotFoundPage.razor

PURPOSE:
The page for a host name that is no tenant, or a path that is no page (404).

RESPONSIBILITIES:
- Show the page for a host name that is no tenant (404)

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Markup only. Text comes from OperationsText (L-10)
- Tenant surface: never says "Vixly" (ADR-0012 W-1)
- Placeholder look: Frontend/UI designs the final experience
- Never sets the status itself: the tenant check or the router sets 404 (a 404 set while rendering empties the page)
=========================================================
*@
@page "/not-found"
@inject IStringLocalizer<OperationsText> T

<PageTitle>@T["ui.tenant.not_found.title"]</PageTitle>
<h1>@T["ui.tenant.not_found.title"]</h1>
<p>@T["ui.tenant.not_found.body"]</p>
